# Lectio supplement to eng.vrs (mapping lines only, same "THIS = ORIGINAL" format).
# Lines here take precedence over eng.vrs. Maintained by Lectio, not by SIL.
#
# Lectio's "english" scheme cites Daniel as Catholic English Bibles do (RSV-CE,
# RSV-2CE): eng.vrs's DAG, with the Greek additions inside chapter 3 and Susanna
# and Bel as chapters 13 and 14. eng.vrs maps only DAG 13-14, so the rest is
# given here. The lines combine eng.vrs's own DAN mapping (Aramaic 3:31-4:34 and
# 5:31-6:28 shifts) with vul.vrs's mapping of the additions onto S3Y.
DAG 1:1-21 = DAN 1:1-21
DAG 2:1-49 = DAN 2:1-49
DAG 3:1-23 = DAN 3:1-23
DAG 3:24-90 = S3Y 1:1-67
DAG 3:91-97 = DAN 3:24-30
DAG 4:1-3 = DAN 3:31-33
DAG 4:4-37 = DAN 4:1-34
DAG 5:1-30 = DAN 5:1-30
DAG 5:31 = DAN 6:1
DAG 6:1-28 = DAN 6:2-29
DAG 7:1-28 = DAN 7:1-28
DAG 8:1-27 = DAN 8:1-27
DAG 9:1-27 = DAN 9:1-27
DAG 10:1-21 = DAN 10:1-21
DAG 11:1-45 = DAN 11:1-45
DAG 12:1-13 = DAN 12:1-13
DAG 13:1-64 = SUS 1:1-64
DAG 14:1-42 = BEL 1:1-42
